​Test Case 1: Valid User Login (EP1 - Valid Class)
​Test Case ID: TC_SD_01
​Title: Verify successful login with valid credentials
​Input Data: Username = standard_user, Password = secret_sauce
​Steps:
​Go to https://www.saucedemo.com/
​Enter standard_user in the Username field.
​Enter secret_sauce in the Password field.
​Click Login.
​Expected Result: Page redirects to the inventory catalog (/inventory.html).

​Test Case 2: Locked Out User (EP2 - Business Rule Exception)
​Test Case ID: TC_SD_02
​Title: Verify error message for a locked-out user account
​Input Data: Username = locked_out_user, Password = secret_sauce
​Steps:
​Go to https://www.saucedemo.com/
​Enter locked_out_user in the Username field.
​Enter secret_sauce in the Password field.
​Click Login.
​Expected Result: Red error banner appears stating: "Epic sadface: Sorry, this user has been locked out."

